{{define "subject"}}Activate your account{{end}}

{{define "plainBody"}}
Hello,

Welcome to the service! Use the token below to activate your account:

{{.ActivationToken}}

Send it to the activation endpoint as JSON:

    PUT /v1/tokens/activation
    {"token": "{{.ActivationToken}}"}

The token is valid for 3 days. If you did not create an account, you can
safely ignore this email.
{{end}}

{{define "htmlBody"}}
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Welcome to the service! Use the token below to activate your account:</p>
<pre>{{.ActivationToken}}</pre>
<p>Send it to the <code>PUT /v1/tokens/activation</code> endpoint as JSON.
The token is valid for 3 days.</p>
{{end}}
